Describe the bundled catalog, and fetch the motors and files ThrustCurve.org lists that it lacks into the cache

Usage: hpr motors update [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text, errors included

      --offline
          Answer from the cache only, never the network: what an earlier update found, or, with none cached, the bundled catalog alone

      --color <WHEN>
          When to use color. With auto, output to a terminal is colored, and NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE are followed. JSON output never has color
          
          [default: auto]
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  Fetch the motors and files ThrustCurve.org lists that the bundle lacks:
      hpr motors update
  Show the bundled catalog's date, counts and size, with no network:
      hpr motors update --offline

Guide: https://hpr.fusionspace.co/cli.html#newer-motors-and-the-bundles-date
